'''Doritos''' was a [[Rare Weapons|rare]] knife that was originally obtainable by unboxing it from the [[MLG Box]]. Doritos was soon deleted from the game after [[Nikilis]] removed the [[MLG Box]] from the shop due to copyright reasons.

== Appearance ==
The blade on the knife has a red color and a logo, a golden hilt of a translucent dorito, and a black handle.

== Trivia ==
*The logo on the blade is from a popular chips brand known as [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Doritos Doritos].
*When the [[MLG Box]] was removed and temporarily replaced with the [[Chroma Box]], this knife had the Doritos logo removed from the blade and the handle was retextured to be darker. It was renamed to [[Scarlet]].
*This, along with every other item in the [[MLG Box]], was removed from all players' [[Inventory|inventories]].

